    <bpmn:process id="W_W1776" name="W1776. Promotional Installment Subsidy Accounting" isExecutable="false">
      <bpmn:documentation>Trigger: 0% interest promotion active; BuildRight subsidizes interest cost to financing partner
Frequency: ~6–10 promotional periods/year
Volume: ~PHP 5–15M in annual installment subsidies
Owner: FP&amp;A
Participants: FP&amp;A, Accounting Manager, VP Merchandising, Category Managers
Source: workflow W1776 — Promotional Installment Subsidy Accounting</bpmn:documentation>
      <bpmn:laneSet id="W1776_LaneSet4">
        <bpmn:lane id="W1776_Lane1" name="System">
        <bpmn:flowNodeRef>W1776_Task6</bpmn:flowNodeRef>
        <bpmn:flowNodeRef>W1776_Start5</bpmn:flowNodeRef>
        </bpmn:lane>
        <bpmn:lane id="W1776_Lane2" name="FP&amp;A">
        <bpmn:flowNodeRef>W1776_Task7</bpmn:flowNodeRef>
        </bpmn:lane>
        <bpmn:lane id="W1776_Lane3" name="Accounting Manager">
        <bpmn:flowNodeRef>W1776_Task8</bpmn:flowNodeRef>
        <bpmn:flowNodeRef>W1776_End9</bpmn:flowNodeRef>
        </bpmn:lane>
      </bpmn:laneSet>
      <bpmn:startEvent id="W1776_Start5" name="0% interest promotion active; BuildRight subsidizes interest cost to financing partner">
        <bpmn:outgoing>W1776_Flow12</bpmn:outgoing>
      </bpmn:startEvent>
      <bpmn:serviceTask id="W1776_Task6" name="During promotional period: (a) system records each 0% installment transaction…">
        <bpmn:documentation>Step 1: During promotional period: (a) system records each 0% installment transaction at full selling price, (b) financing partner charges BuildRight a subsidy fee (higher MDR or explicit subsidy amount) to compensate for interest they forego, (c) subsidy cost recorded as promotional selling expense (allocated to the promoting category)
Responsible (R): System
Accountable (A): Accounting Manager
Duration: Automated</bpmn:documentation>
        <bpmn:incoming>W1776_Flow12</bpmn:incoming>
        <bpmn:outgoing>W1776_Flow13</bpmn:outgoing>
      </bpmn:serviceTask>
      <bpmn:userTask id="W1776_Task7" name="Monthly: FP&amp;A tracks promotional subsidy cost: (a) total subsidy amount by…">
        <bpmn:documentation>Step 2: Monthly: FP&amp;A tracks promotional subsidy cost: (a) total subsidy amount by promotion and category, (b) incremental sales generated by promotion vs. non-promotional period, (c) subsidy cost as % of incremental gross margin, (d) ROI: incremental margin ÷ subsidy cost (target: &gt; 3x)
Responsible (R): FP&amp;A
Accountable (A): CFO
Duration: 1 day/month during promos</bpmn:documentation>
        <bpmn:incoming>W1776_Flow13</bpmn:incoming>
        <bpmn:outgoing>W1776_Flow14</bpmn:outgoing>
      </bpmn:userTask>
      <bpmn:userTask id="W1776_Task8" name="Post-promotion: Accounting Manager reconciles subsidy charges from financing…">
        <bpmn:documentation>Step 3: Post-promotion: Accounting Manager reconciles subsidy charges from financing partner against system records; discrepancies resolved; final promotional P&amp;L prepared for category review
Responsible (R): Accounting Manager
Accountable (A): CFO
Duration: 1 week post-promo</bpmn:documentation>
        <bpmn:incoming>W1776_Flow14</bpmn:incoming>
        <bpmn:outgoing>W1776_Flow15</bpmn:outgoing>
      </bpmn:userTask>
      <bpmn:endEvent id="W1776_End9" name="Complete">
        <bpmn:incoming>W1776_Flow15</bpmn:incoming>
      </bpmn:endEvent>
      <bpmn:textAnnotation id="W1776_Annotation10">
        <bpmn:text>Controls: - CTL-356 (ensure controlled execution — Installment Sale Processing &amp; Monitoring (PA-38.2).) | - operational: FP&amp;A review and approval gate; periodic reconciliation against source documents
Owner: FP&amp;A</bpmn:text>
      </bpmn:textAnnotation>
